WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.231
Day eight.

00:00:01.231 --> 00:00:02.566
Things are starting to feel more

00:00:02.566 --> 00:00:05.039
familiar—but you're still new.

00:00:05.039 --> 00:00:06.757
Jordan gives you a task using a

00:00:06.757 --> 00:00:09.323
process everyone else seems to understand.

00:00:09.323 --> 00:00:12.051
You understood some of the explanation, but not

00:00:12.051 --> 00:00:14.408
enough to feel sure you'll do it correctly.

00:00:14.408 --> 00:00:16.498
This happens in real workplaces.

00:00:16.498 --> 00:00:18.843
Not knowing something isn't the problem.

00:00:18.843 --> 00:00:20.968
What you do next can determine whether this

00:00:20.968 --> 00:00:23.499
becomes a learning moment or a bigger issue.
